ndN9U9je6oemN2gC2j-S3O5feYAltJLbn-w0A3LjA&oe=6AFDE2EC"}, {"file_name": "WhatsApp Image 2026-10-31 at 14.27.18 (1).png", "id": "1117542131124891", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827987_1117542137791557_8690170285324933060_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wipT4l_yxTIQ7kNvwGikpP8&_nc_oc=AdrMSvQ9dqZlpSueAIzrTCeExh7IKpNSE5AFHtTT3Dv0-csN1HIjydLuIstWZT-8Dko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRYDn3ODvz2j-e6GnF3qTTZygOrJ5KyKcSKmledctUd0g&oe=6AFDC00E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bytestudio Remote Desktop", "keywords": ["desktop", "linux", "ubuntu", "remote", "remotedesktop"], "long_description": "## Remote desktop for Meta Quest \u2014 Linux first.\n##\n\nYour computer, in VR. Two flat screens float in front of you, windows move between them, and you work with hands, controllers or a keyboard. Hardware decoding, audio in the headset, passthrough around the screens.\n\n**Multi-platform by design**: it speaks standard RDP. Linux is tested first, with GNOME Remote Desktop on Ubuntu 26.04. Windows Pro works the same way, but that path is not tested yet.\n\n## Features\n- **Two screens** at 1280x720 each, or one at 1600x900\n- **72 to 90 fps**, hardware decoding\n- Drag windows between screens, move and resize panels\n- Stabilized pointer for controllers and hands\n- Text clipboard both ways, virtual keyboard\n- Certificate pinning (TOFU, like SSH)\n\n## Requirements\n- Quest 3 or 3S\n- A PC with an RDP server: GNOME on Ubuntu (tested), Windows Pro (not tested yet)\n- Local network recommended, Ethernet or Wi-Fi 5/6 GHz\n\n## Limitations\n- **Two screens need a remote session**; mirroring an open desktop stays at one screen\n- Windows and other RDP servers: supported, not tested yet\n- No microphone, no file transfer, no auto-reconnect\n- Early Access: things will break, feedback shapes what comes next\n\n## Coming next\n- **Third screen, curved screens, smart positioning**\n\n## Getting started\n1. Enable Remote Desktop on the PC\n2. Install on Quest, enter the address and credentials\n3. Port 3389 opens a new session, 3390 shares the open one\n4. Accept the certificate, work in VR", "short_description": "Remote desktop (RDP) client  on Meta Quest 3\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bytestudio-vr.github.io/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "byte_studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bytestudio-vr.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1509971895524524"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_4628137710738046_2538869669256798471_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nzTavAm5ax8Q7kNvwHu44TN&_nc_oc=AdoQ5VamRtJkSITmRnZJO98_XLpJT3uBjXJWDV2VvPCTtGl1HCkr1mr09BYfy21UULc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRh-qNaJ6z5jUhkYBF8j6jBvSMctBiHJAfwYH4dUIlhjw&oe=6AFDCD9B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Bytestudio Remote Desktop", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "3